--- emphasis
<p><em>a</em> <em>b</em> <strong>c</strong> <strong>d</strong> <em><strong>e</strong></em> <em>a <strong>b</strong> c</em></p>

--- intraword
<p>foo<em>bar</em>baz foo_bar_baz snake_case_name</p>

--- flanking
<p>a * b * c ** d ** e _ f _</p>

--- nested runs
<p><em>foo<strong>bar</strong>baz</em> <strong>foo<em>bar</em>baz</strong></p>

--- rule of three
<p><em>foo**bar</em> <em><strong>foo</strong> bar</em> <em>foo</em>**</p>

--- strikethrough
<p><del>gone</del> <del>single</del> ~~~triple~~~</p>

--- code spans
<p><code>a</code> <code>a`b</code> <code>a</code> <code>  </code> <code>x `` y</code></p>

--- links
<p><a href="/u" title="t">a</a> <a href="/u%20v">b</a> <a href="/u(x)">c</a> <a href="/u)">d</a> <a href="/u(x)" title="t">e</a> <a href="">f</a></p>

--- links with parentheses
<p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Low_(language)">w</a> and <a href="a(b(c))d">n</a></p>

--- link nesting
<p>[a <a href="/b">b</a> c](/a) <a href="/e"><em>em</em></a> <img src="/i.png" alt="img x" title="T"></p>

--- references
<p><a href="/one" title="First">one</a> <a href="two.md">two</a> <a href="/three">3</a> [missing][x]</p>

--- autolinks
<p><a href="https://example.com/a?b=c">https://example.com/a?b=c</a> <a href="mailto:me@example.com">me@example.com</a> <a href="https://example.com/x">https://example.com/x</a>). <a href="http://www.example.com">www.example.com</a>, <a href="mailto:user@example.org">user@example.org</a>.</p>

--- inline html
<p>a <span class="x">b</span> <!-- c --> <br/> &lt;3 &lt; 4</p>

--- breaks
<p>soft
break and hard<br>break and hard<br>break</p>

--- escapes
<p>*not* # [x] a\b \ `</p>

--- entities
<p>&amp; &copy; A A &bogus; &amp; AT&amp;T</p>

--- special characters
<p>1 &lt; 2 &amp;&amp; 3 &gt; 2 &quot;quoted&quot; &#39;single&#39;</p>

bold code link alt <b>raw</b> &
|
